message: "If you use Ocean Optics Explorer in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Ocean Optics Explorer"
version: "0.1.0-beta"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.21495851"
url: "https://github.com/AquarelaCebimar/Ocean-Color-Explorer"
abstract: >-
  Ocean Optics Explorer is a scientific application for processing, visualizing,
  and analysing in-water optical and hydrographic profiles, including
  remote-sensing reflectance and satellite spectral convolution.
